  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.2 (bug-fix release): bool? properties no longer throw at render; DateTime / DateTimeOffset time pickers no longer disappear from saved forms on reload (lost ones are restored); JSON export ships its own script (no window.formazeExport snippet needed); properties the renderer cannot bind (nested objects, arrays, get-only members) are skipped instead of rendered as a text box that throws, and short/byte/unsigned integers render as numeric inputs; validation follows a replaced Model instance; numeric rules and conditions parse \"3,5\" correctly under comma-decimal cultures; Group.Columns clamped; repeater Add disabled without a parameterless constructor. Changed: AddFormazeInMemory now registers a thread-safe singleton store (was scoped, one copy per circuit on Blazor Server). The full history ships in the package as CHANGELOG.md.",
